@startuml
[*] --> SystemReady

SystemReady -> SavingMetadata : User saves metadata
SavingMetadata -> SystemReady : Metadata saved successfully

SystemReady -> RetrievingMetadata : User retrieves metadata
RetrievingMetadata -> SystemReady : Metadata retrieved successfully

SystemReady -> HandlingMultipleUsers : System handles multiple users/items
HandlingMultipleUsers -> SystemReady : Multiple users/items handled

SystemReady -> ErrorHandling : Error occurs
ErrorHandling -> SystemReady : Error resolved

SystemReady -> Feedback : System provides feedback
Feedback -> SystemReady : Feedback acknowledged

SystemReady --> SystemShutdown : System shuts down
SystemShutdown --> [*]

SavingMetadata -> ErrorHandling : Error during saving
RetrievingMetadata -> ErrorHandling : Error during retrieval
HandlingMultipleUsers -> ErrorHandling : Error during handling
Feedback -> ErrorHandling : Error during feedback
@enduml
